--------------------------- INGRESS ----------------------

- Ingress :- Ingress is the traffic re-routing or traffic controller.

/nginx -> nginx-service
/node -> node-service

- NOTE :- Open source Nginx Ingress controller which has been archived and not currently maintaing anymore, it was used in k8s world. 
https://github.com/kubernetes/ingress-NGINX 

FOR KIND INGRESS CONTROLLER :- https://kind.sigs.k8s.io/docs/user/ingress/